natural_earth_countries.bin
================================

Source: Natural Earth, Admin 0 - Countries, 1:110m, version 5.1.1
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/110m-cultural-vectors/

Natural Earth data is in the public domain.
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

The asset was generated from:
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/blob/master/geojson/ne_110m_admin_0_countries.geojson

Run tools/build_world_map_asset.py to rebuild it. The packed file retains the
simplified outlines, ADM0/ISO identifiers, English and Russian country names,
common Natural Earth name variants, and region tags. It intentionally omits
all other GeoJSON properties and requires no runtime mapping dependency.
